					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120603,
					"content": "找到了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120604,
					"content": "卡利贝尔，别往前走了，是我，是爸爸！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120605,
					"content": "不管你看到了什么，那些…那些都是幻觉，都是骗你的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120606,
					"content": "爸爸说过了，这里是童话的世界，不是真的。来，快过来，跟我一起回去！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120607,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "卡利贝尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120608,
					"content": "卡利贝尔？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120609,
						80120610
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120609,
					"content": "没有反应…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120611
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120611,
					"content": "怎么回事，他应该已经恢复神智了啊？应该听得懂我说话啊？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120612,
					"content": "喂，卡利贝尔，我们回家吧，一起回家，好吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120613,
						80120614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "埃德"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120613,
					"content": "等等，他的状态好像有点不太对…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80120615
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80120615,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "卡利贝尔"
				},
				{
					"id": 80120614,
					"content": "难道说是那种力量的影响…？",
